NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000081 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000082 "This document describes version 0.04 of Scalar::Util::Numeric::PP (from Perl distribution Scalar-Util-Numeric-PP), released on 2016-01-22."
