NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000084 "=head1 SYNOPSIS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000085 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000086 "=head1 DESCRIPTION"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000087 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000088 "This module is written mainly for the convenience of L<Data::Sah>, as a drop-in"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000089 "pure-perl replacement for the XS module L<Scalar::Util::Numeric>, in the case"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000090 "when Data::Sah needs to generate code that uses PP modules instead of XS ones."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000091 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000092 "Not all functions from Scalar::Util::Numeric have been provided."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000093 ""
